{"game": "helldivers-2", "language": "schinese", "appid": 553850, "month": "2025-06", "window": 2, "start_date": 1749427200, "end_date": 1750031999, "month_true_total": 2572, "quota": 8, "returned": 8, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 22:28:41 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "197342171", "author": {"steamid": "76561198424069129", "personaname": "wintergay", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198424069129/", "num_games_owned": 59, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 16533, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 659, "playtime_at_review": 2370, "last_played": 1788040257, "avatar": "e2f0ede3ca3cdae34ee58497d1bf90e623639b6b"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "hao zou xi, shi wo de shi ti yai kong yhong xuan yhuan", "timestamp_created": 1750031109, "timestamp_updated": 1750031109, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "197339384", "author": {"steamid": "76561197991529880", "personaname": "阿赖耶", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197991529880/", "num_games_owned": 161, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 50993, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 808, "playtime_at_review": 19758, "last_played": 1788064214, "avatar": "41e49bae846f4f6256e435ca8c935dcccba73f5c"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "[h1] HELLDIVERS™ 2好玩吗？ [/h1]\n好啊，很好啊\n[b] 本作特别突出的亮点就是沉浸感：ui设计，画面，音效都能将你拉入游戏中，身临其境地为了管理式民主而战\n这对于我来说是要命的吸引力，也是为什么我能在“沪爷保卫战”之前就玩了300多小时 [/b]\n请各位注意”超级地球保卫战“只是这游戏的一个事件，不是这个游戏的全部，要是只是为了保护所谓”超级上海“,那未免太浪费了\n西线作战：机器人阵营，放个bgm都能让人觉得这就是《星球大战》的程度，但是十分吃游戏理解，不建议新手打，处处是惊喜\n东线作战：终结族阵营，原汁原味的沾豆爽体验，除了胆汁喷涌虫让人物理上血脉喷张之外，都很有特色，最推荐\n南线，，，，？作战：光能者阵营：保卫战之前最菜的飞舞，萌新首选，新版本之后打光能就是赤石\n[b] 总之，不论你是喜欢战场氛围感，还是单纯和朋友当成派对游戏开黑，这游戏在打折后都是不二之选，友军伤害是其中的灵魂，和朋友度过互相伤害的50小时或者跟着匹配的队友为管理式民主冲锋陷阵都值回了这游戏打折150的票价 [/b]\n[spoiler] 出生箭头你改悔罢！ [/spoiler]\n", "timestamp_created": 1750027472, "timestamp_updated": 1750027669, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.512499988079071045", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "197339314", "author": {"steamid": "76561198351492030", "personaname": "jay_doraemon", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198351492030/", "num_games_owned": 140, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 9057, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 7236, "last_played": 1771000972, "avatar": "f4e28e50af13b80f549eab926bba6a4d28a14d38"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "电脑里有一款玩了一年的特性第二年被当成bug修掉的游戏\nfku arrowhead\n又开了两局机器人之后我只想操死你的妈", "timestamp_created": 1750027392, "timestamp_updated": 1750031230, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "197334034", "author": {"steamid": "76561198175554231", "personaname": "Siu", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198175554231/", "num_games_owned": 519, "num_reviews": 13, "playtime_forever": 6935, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5753, "last_played": 1753361296, "avatar": "9e5f8b2f1bf8473fc409e28caaaaf7df1b6dd50b"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "又香又臭，暂时香", "timestamp_created": 1750021742, "timestamp_updated": 1750021742, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "receiv